---- Changes since 0.1.1 ----
Host resources (CPU load, memory, disks) are now the first section and are
shown as ring gauges.
---- Changes since 0.1.0 ----
The "Updated ... ago / Refreshes every ..." caption is now shown at the top of
the page instead of in the header, where the Authentic theme clipped it.
---- Changes since 0.0 ----
First release: runners (busy/idle/offline with current job), queued jobs with
label matching, host load/memory/disk and container CPU/memory.
